{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17310","headline":"送从弟谒员外叔父回归义兴 · 权德舆","name":"送从弟谒员外叔父回归义兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异乡兄弟少，见尔自依然。\n来酌林中酒，去耕湖上田。\n何朝逢暑雨，几夜泊鱼烟。\n余力当勤学，成名贵少年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}